---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+17044696658";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (704) 469-6658";
---
<Layout title="Emergency AC Repair Gastonia NC | 24 Hour AC Repair | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="24/7 emergency AC repair in Gastonia, NC. Same-day response, licensed technicians, upfront pricing. Call +1 (704) 469-6658.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/services/emergency-ac-repair/">Services</a> / Emergency AC Repair</p>
      <h1>Emergency AC Repair in Gastonia, NC</h1>
      <p>Residential · Fast Response · Honest Service. When your AC stops cooling — we move fast.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Gastonia summers don't forgive a broken air conditioner. Whether it's warm air pushing through the vents, a system that stopped mid-afternoon, or humidity making sleep impossible — urgent AC repair starts with a technician at your door, not a voicemail.</p>
      <p>We diagnose the root cause first — refrigerant leaks, compressor issues, electrical faults — and give you a clear answer before any work begins. <strong>Same-day availability</strong>, licensed & insured in Gaston County, with a <strong>98% first-visit fix rate</strong>.</p>

      <h2>When Cooling Problems Need Immediate Attention</h2>
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin:1.5rem 0">
        <div class="card"><h3>AC Won't Turn On</h3><p>Tripped breakers, failed capacitors, or seized compressor. Diagnose startup failure quickly.</p><span class="badge badge-danger">Critical</span></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Blowing Warm Air</h3><p>Usually refrigerant loss, failing compressor, or blocked condenser. Worsens with continued operation.</p><span class="badge badge-danger">Critical</span></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Frozen Evaporator Coils</h3><p>Ice blocks airflow and risks water damage when it melts. Turn off system and call for service.</p><span class="badge badge-danger">Urgent</span></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Water Leaking</h3><p>Blocked condensate drain or melting ice. Mold risk within 24–48 hours in Gastonia humidity.</p><span class="badge badge-danger">Urgent</span></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Short Cycling</h3><p>Rapid on/off pattern hard on the compressor. Causes range from oversized equipment to refrigerant issues.</p><span class="badge badge-warn">Address Soon</span></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Sudden Cooling Loss</h3><p>System was working, then stopped entirely. Do not force restart — needs professional diagnosis.</p><span class="badge badge-danger">Critical</span></div>
      </div>

      <h2>What to Expect During Your Emergency Repair</h2>
      <ol style="list-style:decimal;margin-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem"><strong>You reach out</strong> — Call or contact us. No technical knowledge needed. Same-day scheduling available.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem"><strong>We arrive fast</strong> — Fully stocked vehicle. Average response under 60 minutes across Gastonia (often ~47 min).</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem"><strong>Full system inspection</strong> — Indoor unit, outdoor unit, refrigerant, electrical, airflow, controls. We find the root cause.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem"><strong>Clear quote first</strong> — Written estimate before any work. You approve — or don't. No surprise charges.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem"><strong>Cooling restored</strong> — Repair completed, system tested under load. 98% first-visit fix rate.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="cta-box">
        <p>Need emergency AC repair in Gastonia right now?</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Related Services</h2>
      <p><a href="/services/refrigerant-leak-repair/">Refrigerant Leak Repair</a> · <a href="/services/compressor-repair/">Compressor Repair</a> · <a href="/services/same-day-ac-repair/">Same-Day AC Repair</a> · <a href="/services/drain-line-cleaning/">Drain Line Cleaning</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
